      "tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2086719019369869522",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T07:39:18.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086719019369869522",
          "textSnippet": "Government says they're focused on \"providing stability\" through oil and gas.\n\nAn absolute dereliction of first duty to keep us safe.\n\nIt won't boost the economy for the people but further obscene profits for fossil fuel companies & their shareholders."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086719655926739393",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T07:41:50.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086719655926739393",
          "textSnippet": "We're about to go into our fifth heatwave with already thousands of people dead.\n\nCalling a COBR meeting was not sufficient - just first necessary one to make a plan of action.\n\nThey're not even doing the basics to keep us safe. Yet are prepared to make everything much worse."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086720239224471656",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T07:44:09.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086720239224471656",
          "textSnippet": "This is not something where we get many second chances.\n\nEvery moment of delay all mounts up to much bigger problems in future years that will make this summer look easy.\n\nWe must keep the pressure on for Andy Burnham and the Government to finally do the right thing."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086721002377994426",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T07:47:11.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086721002377994426",
          "textSnippet": "I made clear in my press conference last week, this needs to be treated for the serious crisis it is, with financial support for homes to keep cool and for fossil fuel giants to pay the costs of extreme weather adaptation."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086851739207041195",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T16:26:41.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086851739207041195",
          "textSnippet": "More unbelievable is that I've asked Sadiq Khan several times over years whether the government should nationalise Thames Water and he's never said \"Yes.\"\n\nSo less hand wringing and more change."
        },
        {
          "id": "2086851875442204720",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T16:27:13.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2086851875442204720",
          "textSnippet": "Here's my conversation with Fergal Sharkey who lays out how it can be done."
        }
      ]
